<title>Computer Science Timeline</title>
<style>
body{margin:0;padding:25px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:#f8f0ff;color:#3f2e52}
header{text-align:center;background:#8054a9;color:white;padding:30px;border-radius:18px}
main{max-width:800px;margin:30px auto;border-left:4px solid #b28ad2;padding-left:22px}
.event{background:white;padding:19px;margin:20px 0;border-radius:12px;position:relative;box-shadow:0 3px 10px #e7d9f0}
.event:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:-32px;top:22px;width:15px;height:15px;border-radius:50%;background:#8054a9}
.year{font-weight:bold;color:#8054a9;font-size:19px}
</style>
